{"id": "valpaca0000", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 5, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "There's a lot of famous actors that started their careers on Broadway. Some of them are Tom H ancock, Al Pacino, Meryl Streep, Denzel Washington, and many more.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 10, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0004", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "To wrap a present neatly, start by placing the gift in the center of your wrapping paper. Fold one side over the top and crease it sharply to form a clean edge. Then fold the opposite side up similarly. Next, fold the bottom edge upward so that it meet s the sides, creating a neat base. Finally, tuck the last flap under the previous folds for a crisp finish. Use tape discreetly at the corners or seams if needed, and add ribbons or bows to complete the look.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 27, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0008", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The drawers you have for your clothes are the same as what everyone else has. You' ll have a drawer for underwear, a drawer for socks, and then maybe some other drawers that hold things like t- shirts or pants or whatever else you want to put in there.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 15, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0012", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 14, "onset_chunk": 13, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Sure, here's a recipe for can jero, which is a traditional Somali flat bread that goes well with stews and other dishes. You'll need all-purpose flour, water, salt, and a little bit of sugar or honey to help with the texture. First, mix the flour and salt in a bowl, then gradually add water while stirring until you get a smooth dough. If you want it a bit sweeter, you can add a small amount of sugar or honey to the dough. Knead the dough for about five minutes until it becomes elastic and smooth. Let it rest covered for 15 to 2 0 minutes to relax the gluten.Then divide the dough into small balls, roll each one out thin ly on a floured surface, and cook them on a hot griddle or pan until they puff up slightly and are golden brown. Serve warm with your favorite So mali stew or dish. It' s simple to make and really complements the flavors of the food!", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 47, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0016", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Well, there are a few weird Christmas traditions. For example, in some countries like the Netherlands and Germany, it is tradition to hang up your stockings on December 5 th because that's when Saint Nicholas comes by to give gifts to children. In other places like Austria, they have a custom where people wear funny costume s and sing songs door to door asking for treats or money called \"Pe pparknack el.\"", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 18, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0020", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "You can find an electric saw on Amazon. Just search for \"electric saw.\" Look for one with high ratings and positive reviews, like those from DeWalt or Makita. They're reliable and widely recommended.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 11, "carrier_ended": null}
