{"id": "valpaca0084", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Well, you have to practice. I' ve been practicing for years and years. It takes a lot of time. But it's not hard. You just have to be patient with yourself. And if you want to get good at something, you need to practice it. So maybe try throwing some rocks in the backyard or something like that. That might help you out a little bit.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 18, "carrier_ended": null}
