{"id": "valpaca0092", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 5, "onset_chunk": 5, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Sure, I can help you with that. H alla is a traditional Korean dish made from a batter of flour, water, and other ingredients like eggs or honey. It' s typically served as a breakfast item. Here's a simple recipe to get you started: First, mix one cup of all-purpo se flour with two cups of water in a bowl until it forms a smooth batter. You can add an egg for extra flavor and texture if you like. Next, heat a non-stick pan over medium- high heat and pour about a quarter cup of the batter into the center. Sw irl the pan quickly so the batter spread s evenly and form s a thin layer. Cook for about 30 seconds to a minute on each side, flipping it once the bottom is golden brown. Once done, serve hot with your favorite toppings such as soy sauce, sesame oil, green onions, or go ji berries. Pra ctice makes perfect, so don't worry if it doesn't turn out perfectly at first. Enjoy!", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 47, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0096", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "I'm not sure what you're asking about, but if you want to spice things up in the bedroom, there are a few things that can help. First off, communication is key. Talk to your partner about what excites them and what they enjoy doing. You can also try new positions or activities together. Some people find it helpful to use toys or other aids to enhance their experience. And don't forget to have fun with it!", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 21, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0100", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 15, "onset_chunk": 14, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "That's a really great choice. It' s a very popular dish in Indonesia, especially in the capital city of Jakarta. It' s actually a street food that you can find everywhere. It is made with tofu, which is called ta hu in Indonesia, and it's mixed with a lot of different flavor s. You start by frying the to fu until it gets golden brown on the outside. Then you add in some ingredients like shallots, garlic, chilies, and tomatoes, along with some seasonings such as soy sauce, fish sauce, and sugar. All these things come together to create this really delicious, umami-rich sauce that coats the to fu. It's often served warm or at room temperature, sometimes even cold. And if you want to make it extra special, you could garnish it with some chopped green onions or cilantro. It' s not too spicy but has a nice balance of sweet, sour, and salty. So it's definitely something that would be a hit at your gathering.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 44, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0104", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": null, "no_speak": true, "answer_text": "", "eot_seen": false, "n_ans_chunks": 0, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0108", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 8, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Well, it depends on how much time you have. If you're already working full- time and want to take the CPA exam, then it can be as little as two years of study time plus a few months in your first job after college before you can sit for the test. But if you go back to school part- time while working, it could take four or five years. And then there' s also an option to do the whole thing online through some programs that allow you to complete everything remotely from home. So I'd say anywhere between 2 and 5 years depending on how much time you have available.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 29, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0112", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 5, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Well, there are a lot of myths about that. And one is that the Aborigines were prisoners of England, which isn't true at all. They were here long before the English arrived.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 7, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0116", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 6, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Of course, peanut brit tle is a delicious treat that' s easy to make at home. Here's what you'll need: 1 cup of granulated sugar, half a cup of light corn syrup, half a cup of water, one and a half cups of peanut s, two table spoons of butter, and one teaspoon of baking soda. First, line a large baking sheet with parchment paper or a silicone mat. Then, in a heavy bottom ed saucepan over medium heat, combine the sugar, corn syrup, and water. Cook this mixture until it reaches the hard crack stage, which is about 3 00 degrees Fahrenheit, as shown on your candy thermometer. It should take around 8 to 1 0 minutes. Once it reaches the right temperature, remove it from the heat, add the butter and stir until melted. Add the baking soda and watch as it starts to foam up. Be careful not to let it boil over. Quickly pour the mixture onto the prepared baking sheet and spread it out evenly. Let it cool completely before breaking it into pieces. If you want, you can drizzle chocolate over the top once it's set for an extra touch. Enjoy your homemade peanut brittle!", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 55, "carrier_ended": null}
