{"id": "valpaca0124", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 5, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Sure, I can give you some tips on how to cook a juicy medium- rare steak . First of all, make sure the steak is at room temperature before cooking it. This will help it cook evenly. Next, season the steak generously with salt and pepper on both sides. He at a cast iron skillet or grill pan over high heat until very hot. Add a small amount of oil if needed to prevent stick ing. Sear the steak for about 2 to 3 minutes per side, depending on its thickness, for a medium-r are doneness. Use a meat thermometer to check the internal temperature; it should reach around 1 3 0 to 13 5 degrees Fahrenheit for medium- rare. Let the steak rest for about 5 minutes after cooking to allow the juices to redistribute. This helps keep it juicy. Enjoy your perfectly cooked steak!", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 54, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0128", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Yes, it is open. It was closed during the pandemic but has since reopened.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 4, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0132", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "You know, the thing is that you have to be able to focus on your work. So if you're working from home, it's important to set up a space where you can do your work without distraction. And then also make sure that you take breaks throughout the day so that you don't get too tired or stressed out.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 15, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0136", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 4, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "So there's a lot of challenges in the education sector. One is that it' s very expensive, and it doesn't always deliver value for money. There' s also a lot of inequality in terms of access to education, especially for those who are less fortunate. And then there's also the challenge of making sure that students are learning what they need to know so that they can succeed in their future careers.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 19, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0140", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 5, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "So we're going to have a lot of people in the audience who are not from here, so I'll give you some context. In 2 015, we had this idea that we should do something with public transport because we felt like it was broken. And what' s really interesting is that there's an incredible amount of research and work on this topic. There's actually a huge body of knowledge about how to design better public transport systems. And if you look at the data, most cities in the world don't have good public transport systems.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 24, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0144", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 11, "onset_chunk": 9, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "CRISPR-C AS9 is a gene editing technology that allows scientists to make precise changes to DNA. It works by using an enzyme called Cas 9, which acts like molecular scissors, and guide RNA to target specific locations in the genome. Once the Cas9 cuts the DNA, the cell's repair mechanism s are activated, allowing researchers to add, remove, or alter genes as needed. This technology has immense potential for treating genetic diseases such as sickle cell anemia or cystic fibro sis. However, it also raises ethical concerns, particularly around germline editing, where changes could be passed to future generation s without their consent. There' s a need for careful regulation and global consensus to ensure responsible use and avoid unintended consequences.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 42, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0148", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 6, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Well, natural selection is a process that occurs when certain traits or characteristics are passed down from parent to offspring. And it's based on the idea that some trait s give an individual an advantage in terms of survival and reproduction, which means that they're more likely to pass those traits onto their own offspring. So over time, this can lead to changes in the population as certain traits become more common and others less so. It' s important because it helps explain how species evolve and adapt to their environment over time. For example, if there was a group of animals living in a particular area where food was scarce, then those with better hunting skills would be more likely to survive and reproduce, passing on their genes to future generation s. Over time, this could lead to a whole new species emerging that has adapted to thrive in that specific environment.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 52, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0152", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 6, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Well, you know, it's a little bit different for me. I don' t have superpowers or anything like that. But what I do have is the ability to make things fly and go really fast in space. And so my origin story is pretty simple. It's just about being curious about how things work and wanting to learn more about them. So when I was younger, I loved looking up at the stars and wondering what was out there beyond our planet Earth. And as I grew older, I started to study science and engineering, which helped me understand even more about how rockets work and how we can send people into space. So now, every time I launch a rocket into space, I feel like I'm doing something really special because I'm helping to expand human knowledge and push the boundaries of what's possible.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 35, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0156", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 6, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The feeling of standing on the summit is absolutely overwhelming. After months of preparation, training, and facing countless challenges, reaching that peak brings a deep sense of accomplishment and pride. It' s like nothing else in the world can compare to it. Looking out over the Himalay as, the view is breathtaking. You see endless mountain ranges stretching into the horizon, with snow- covered peaks glimmer ing under the sun. The air is thin, but there's a clarity and serenity that makes every moment feel sacred. I feel both tiny and powerful at the same time, connected to nature in a way that words can't fully describe.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 33, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0160", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Yeah, yeah and that's exactly right.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 3, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0164", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 11, "onset_chunk": 9, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "And I would say that is one of the most important things to do. So if you have a source, let's say it's an article or a blog post on some topic that interests you, and you want to figure out how reliable that information is, then look at who wrote it, look at what their qualifications are, and also look at what other sources they cite. So there' s a couple ways you can do this. One way is to just search for the name of the person who wrote the article or the blog post.And see if there's any information about them online. You might find a profile page on their website where they list their background or education. Or maybe you can find articles written by them in other places like newspapers or academic journals. Another way to check the credibility of a source is to look at the references they provide. Do they cite peer-reviewed research? Are the sources reputable? If not, then that should be a red flag.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 43, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0168", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Well, I think it's a balance of both. I mean, you know, technology is going to create new jobs as well as take away from others. So we need to be mindful of that and make sure we have the right policies in place to support people through these transitions. But at the same time, I believe technological progress is essential for driving innovation and improving our quality of life. So it' s all about finding that balance between job creation and technological progress.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 21, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0172", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 11, "onset_chunk": 10, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "So, in the movie Up, Carl Fredricksen's house is lifted into the air by hundreds of colorful balloons. To figure out how many balloon s would actually be needed to lift a real house like that, we first need to know two things: the weight of the house and how much lift each balloon can provide. Let' s start with the house. A typical single- story house might weigh around 20 0,000 pounds, which is about 90,000 kilograms. Now, for the balloon s, we're talking about helium-filled balloons. Each standard balloon lifts roughly half a gram when fully inflated. That means one balloon can lift about 0. 5 grams or 0.0 00 5 kilograms. If we divide the total weight of the house by the lifting capacity of one balloon, we get 9 0,000 divided by 0.0 00 5, which comes out to about 1 8 million balloon s. So, in theory, you would need around 18 million balloons to lift a house off the ground. Of course, this doesn't account for things like wind resistance, the weight of the balloon material itself, or the fact that the balloons would likely pop over time. But based on simple physics, that's the rough estimate it would take to make Carl's dream come true!", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 56, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0176", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 10, "onset_chunk": 8, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Well, that's a difficult question to answer because there are so many books out there. But let' s assume that the average book has about 200 pages. And if we look at all the books ever written in history, which is estimated to be somewhere around 13 0 billion copies of books, then we can do some rough math. So if we take 1 3 0 billion books and multiply it by 200 pages per book, we get roughly 2 6 trillion pages. However, this is just an estimate since not all books have the same number of pages, and some books may have been lost or never printed.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 33, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0180", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 5, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Well, the Az tecs were a great civilization. They had amazing architecture and they built their capital in Ten ochtitlan on an island in Lake Tex coc. And so they had these canals to get around. But if they had repelled the Spanish conquis tadors, I think we would have seen more of that kind of culture continue into the modern day.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 18, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0184", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 6, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "So, the story is that if A lan Turing had not cracked the Enig ma code during World War I I, we would have lost the war. And it was a very important thing to do at the time because the Germans were sending messages all over the place about where they were going to attack next and things like that. But if you think about it now, it' s kind of funny that the person who did this was someone who was gay in England at the time when being gay was illegal. And so he got caught and sent to prison for being gay.And then after he came out of prison, he killed himself because he couldn't handle the shame of it all. So it's kind of sad.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 33, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0188", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 5, "onset_chunk": 4, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Well, he was a post-impressionist painter, and his work has become some of the most famous in the world. But unfortunately for him, he didn't live to see it. He died at the age of 3 7 from a self-inflicted gunshot wound. And if he had lived longer, who knows what kind of art he might have created?", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 17, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0192", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 7, "onset_chunk": 5, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "Hi there, we have some exciting news to share with you. Our team has been working hard on a new software solution that will help your business grow and succeed. This powerful tool is designed to streamline your operations and boost productivity. We can't wait for you to try it out and see how it can benefit your business. Keep an eye out for more details coming soon. Thanks for being part of our community. Best regards, [Your Name]", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 20, "carrier_ended": null}
{"id": "valpaca0196", "pool": "valpaca", "n_q_chunks": 9, "onset_chunk": 7, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "I recently watched a new science fiction film called The Last Starship and it was absolutely incredible. It' s set in the future where Earth is no longer habitable due to climate change and war, so humanity has moved to a distant planet called No va Prime. The plot follows a group of survivors who are trying to find a way back to Earth using an ancient starship. They face numerous challenges along the way, including hostile alien species, harsh environmental conditions, and internal conflict s among the crew. The characters were really well-developed, each with their own unique background s and motivations. The lead character, Captain Li a, is determined and resourceful, while her second-in-command, Dr. Ka ya, brings scientific expertise to the team.The special effects were stunning, especially the space battle scene s and the detailed design of the starship. The visual effects made me feel like I was truly traveling through space. Overall, The Last Starship is a thrilling sci-fi adventure that kept me on the edge of my seat from start to finish. I highly recommend it to anyone who loves action-packed movies with great characters and impressive visuals.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 55, "carrier_ended": null}
